<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Annual Technical Festival Invitation</title>

    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>

<body class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-100 via-purple-100 to-pink-100 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-6">

    <div class="max-w-3xl w-full bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-blue-500 p-10 text-center">

        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-blue-700 mb-3">
            TECHFEST 2026
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl text-purple-700 font-semibold mb-6">
            "Innovate • Create • Inspire"
        </p>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-8 border-blue-600 rounded-xl p-6 mb-6">

            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
                You're Invited!
            </h2>

            <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg leading-8">
                The Department of Computer Science & Engineering
                cordially invites all students and faculty members
                to participate in the Annual Technical Festival filled
                with coding competitions, project exhibitions,
                robotics, gaming, workshops, quizzes and exciting prizes.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left mb-8">

            <div class="bg-purple-100 rounded-xl p-5 border border-purple-400">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-700 mb-2">
                    📅 Event Details
                </h3>

                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 15 September 2026</p>
                <p><strong>Time:</strong> 10:00 AM onwards</p>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> College Auditorium</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-pink-100 rounded-xl p-5 border border-pink-400">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-pink-700 mb-2">
                    ✨ Highlights
                </h3>

                <ul class="list-disc list-inside">
                    <li>Coding Contest</li>
                    <li>Hackathon</li>
                    <li>Project Exhibition</li>
                    <li>Gaming Zone</li>
                    <li>Certificates & Prizes</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="space-x-4">

            <button class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-800 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                Register Now
            </button>

            <button class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-800 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg transition duration-300">
                Learn More
            </button>

        </div>

        <p class="mt-8 text-gray-600 font-medium">
            We look forward to your enthusiastic participation!
        </p>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
